				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アコーディオン……
日本語では　手風琴　というのです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T08:57:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
